# override parent ignores — everything here is tracked
!*

# ...except python bytecode from the audit tools. verified 2026-07-28: neither
# the repo .gitignore nor core.excludesfile carries a __pycache__ or *.pyc
# pattern, so nothing was ignoring them anywhere and `git add` would sweep them
# up. (an earlier version of this comment blamed the `!*` above for
# re-including them — that was wrong; there was nothing to re-include.)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
